# Edvanta SERVER environment only. Never prefix these with VITE_, NEXT_PUBLIC_,
# REACT_APP_ or anything else that ends up in a browser bundle.
#
# EduBrixVora API index: https://drive-edubrixvora-1.onrender.com/api/v1
# The client normalises a bare origin or ".../api" to ".../api/v1", but setting
# the exact /api/v1 value removes any ambiguity.
#
# Preferred names:
STORAGE_ENDPOINT=https://drive-edubrixvora-1.onrender.com/api/v1
STORAGE_API_KEY=
STORAGE_TIMEOUT_MS=15000
#
# Existing/alternative names are also accepted. Do not set both pairs to
# different values; the STORAGE_* pair wins when present.
# NINE_DRIVE_API_URL=https://drive-edubrixvora-1.onrender.com/api/v1
# NINE_DRIVE_API_KEY=
# NINE_DRIVE_TIMEOUT_MS=15000
# NINE_DRIVE_URL is also accepted as an endpoint alias.
#
# Uploads use POST /resources (or /resources/upload, /upload) under this base.
# Bare /api aliases also exist: /api/resources, /api/resources/upload, /api/upload.
# Create the key in EduBrixVora -> API Management. Scopes: files:read,
# files:write, files:delete. The key owner must have admin or super_admin role.
# The secret is shown once and stored hashed. There are no placeholder keys that
# work: an empty value makes createStorage() throw at startup.
# The key is server-side only; never put it in the frontend bundle or logs.
